    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The digital coliseum where outrage becomes sport saw a perfect farce: a casting decision that broke the internet's classical brain sparked a culture-war fight that went viral. Prominent commentators, like the self-serious custodians of a mythic canon, performed their solemn outrage ritual over accusations of erasing European history. The defenders parried with a share-the-heritage gambit, turning a film project into a meme-epic. The dispute has become a punchline in a culture-war circus, hijacked by the absurdity of the present.",
