    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "An actress who unwittingly became the meme found herself the lightning rod in a mythic farce. The production, as unwitting producers of a meme-epic, faced a predictable shriek from the gallery, fueling an ideological conflict. This public dispute, a societal debate over a creative project, highlights how the Western canon's defenders and its critics turn a cultural event into a spectacle of absurdity, with the solemn auteur's work becoming a viral punchline.",
